Host Header / 403 Errors. Ollama rejects requests where the HTTP Host header does not match localhost or 127.0.0.1 unless OLLAMA_ORIGINS="*" is set or Cloudflare Tunnel rewrites the HTTP Host Header to localhost:11434 in your tunnel route settings.
